  "steps": [
    "Pressure cook the rice and toor dal with the turmeric and 3 cups of the water until very soft, then mash lightly.",
    "Boil the carrot, peas, beans and potato in the remaining water with the tamarind pulp and salt until tender.",
    "Add the bisi bele bath powder and jaggery and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the cooked rice and dal, adding hot water to reach a thick but flowing consistency, and simmer 8 minutes.",
    "Heat the ghee, crackle the mustard seeds, then add the red chillies, curry leaves and cashews until golden.",
    "Pour the tempering over the rice and serve hot with boondi or papad."
  ]
